    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lab Cats</strong> is a <strong>puzzle platformer</strong> game that emphasizes cooperation and coordination, requiring players to work together seamlessly. In this\u00a0<strong>Co-Op</strong> adventure, players control two cats as they attempt to escape a complex lab filled with obstacles that can only be overcome through teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/188620c9e02fedde6dec0ad2d6c99853.poster.avif?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/188620c9e02fedde6dec0ad2d6c99853.webm?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/188620c9e02fedde6dec0ad2d6c99853.mp4?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/4878d20bed4c42f8159d56a9427281b4.webp?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a laboratory where experiments are conducted on cats, a frustrated scientist decides to take a stand. To escape this dreadful place, they release two brave cats, entrusting them with a mission: escape the lab and bring back help from the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/560093f29536dfcc9ffe63204464185b.poster.avif?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/560093f29536dfcc9ffe63204464185b.webm?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/560093f29536dfcc9ffe63204464185b.mp4?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/4ae024b291f2f428bee804f58e59fa7d.webp?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cats use their special collars to activate or deactivate buttons based on their movements.\u00a0This innovative mechanic requires players to carefully plan their movements and engage in strategic teamwork to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/f1c5694fb3cabeda6eea6aac1ffc2127.poster.avif?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/f1c5694fb3cabeda6eea6aac1ffc2127.webm?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/f1c5694fb3cabeda6eea6aac1ffc2127.mp4?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must leverage these mechanics to showcase both their individual skills and teamwork!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/f319cd6cc45f8ec04c65b174057db014.poster.avif?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/f319cd6cc45f8ec04c65b174057db014.webm?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/f319cd6cc45f8ec04c65b174057db014.mp4?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lab Cats</strong> is a <strong>puzzle platformer</strong> game that emphasizes cooperation and coordination, requiring players to work together seamlessly. In this\u00a0<strong>Co-Op</strong> adventure, players control two cats as they attempt to escape a complex lab filled with obstacles that can only be overcome through teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/188620c9e02fedde6dec0ad2d6c99853.poster.avif?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/188620c9e02fedde6dec0ad2d6c99853.webm?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/188620c9e02fedde6dec0ad2d6c99853.mp4?t=1736787070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/4878d20bed4c42f8159d56a9427281b4.webp?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a laboratory where experiments are conducted on cats, a frustrated scientist decides to take a stand. To escape this dreadful place, they release two brave cats, entrusting them with a mission: escape the lab and bring back help from the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/560093f29536dfcc9ffe63204464185b.poster.avif?t=1736787070\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335050/extras/560093f29536dfcc9ffe63204464185b.webm?t=1736